&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain clean data within our internal systems to ensure that both you and Forter’s leadership team have the most accurate info possible about the book of business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
