&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;3-4 years of post-live, client-facing Account Management / Customer Success experience in the Japanese Market.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Fluent Japanese and English Language skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience leading monthly and quarterly business reviews with client executives where you described the value and ROI of your company’s solution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
