&lt;p&gt;Since this is not a current job posting, we will not be checking it with the same frequency as our current open position. For this reason, we will not send rejection emails from this posting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;ll keep your information on file and will reach out if we find a match!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
