&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Own and evolve Forter&#39;s end-to-end partnership strategy for PSPs, issuing banks, and broader financial institutions — translating company objectives into a disciplined, measurable BD plan with clear pipeline and revenue targets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Act as the internal subject-matter expert on the payments and Financial Services landscape; brief GTM leadership on emerging trends, competitive shifts, and white-space opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
