&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead complex, multi-stakeholder deal cycles end-to-end: prospecting, value articulation, solution scoping with Product, commercial negotiation, contracting, and post-signature launch coordination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Structure partnership agreements that are commercially favorable, legally sound, and set both parties up for measurable joint success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
