&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal Sourcing &amp;amp; Pipeline:&lt;/strong&gt; Source and evaluate acquisition and partnership opportunities, building a prioritized pipeline with clear strategic rationale and investment theses.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive M&amp;amp;A transactions end to end, coordinating due diligence, transaction documents, and closing activities across functions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Post-Acquisition Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead integration planning and execution, covering operating model, product/tech integration, data and compliance, and people and culture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
