&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As Forter’s Senior Strategic Partnerships Manager for AI &amp;amp; Agentic Commerce, you will be responsible for developing and executing a comprehensive business development strategy to accelerate the growth of Forter’s AI-powered products across the globe. You will work closely with cross-functional departments to identify partnership opportunities, cultivate strategic alliances, and build relationships with key stakeholders in the e-commerce, AI, and agentic commerce ecosystem. While New York City or London location is preferred, this role can sit remotely, and it reports to the Director of Forter AI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
