&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are on the lookout for a Solutions Consultant to join our team, remotely based in Germany! The ideal candidate will be highly motivated, energetic and a solution-focused leader with strong technical skills, e-commerce architecture experience, and a background working with enterprise customers in a SaaS-based setting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As part of your day-to-day, you will be communicating and demonstrating the value of Forter&#39;s solutions and owning all technical aspects of the sales cycle. You will work collaboratively with a high-performing sales team to uncover customer needs, priorities, and develop value-based use-cases and account engagement strategies. You will leverage your technical and business skills and work in conjunction with Sales, Implementation, Customer Success, R&amp;amp;D and Product Management as a key business advisor and payments product advocate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
