&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Present our fraud prevention, policy-building, and other e-commerce optimisation solutions in a clear manner to both technical and business audiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Work closely with our Sales and Business Development team, meet with clients, and deliver technical insights for business questions regarding the sales process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Conduct solution deep dives with clients and partners to understand their business goals and how Forter can help achieve and even outperform those metrics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Help remove barriers with potential prospects by clearly articulating Forter&#39;s integration technology, and helping scope projects with a relentless drive for quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Prepare and deliver solution messaging in an effort to highlight Forter&#39;s value proposition and unique differentiators&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with internal Product and R&amp;amp;D teams for sharing client and prospect feedback and additional product roadmap insights&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
