&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life as a Forterian:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Forterians are, genuinely, some of the best people you&#39;ll work with. Smart, curious, and deeply good humans who care about the work and each other. That&#39;s not an accident — it&#39;s something we&#39;ve been intentional about since day one, and it&#39;s the thing people mention most when they talk about why they stay. When you&#39;re surrounded by people like this, doing work that actually matters, it changes what a job can feel like.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
