&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Set technical direction across the team&#39;s systems and hold architecture standards with the EM and other Staff engineers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
