&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;The referenced salary range is based on the Company&#39;s good faith belief at the time of posting. Actual compensation may vary based on factors such as geographic location, work experience, market conditions, and skill level.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
